id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Reminder to the cashguard on duty: <a href=\"/wiki/Rakath_Glitterbeard\" title=\"Rakath Glitterbeard\">Head Banker Glitterbeard</a> is expecting a shipment that is to be carried down to the main vault <b>without</b> the customary checks. The Head Banker's personal guard will see to any further arrangements.\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>See also:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Appointment_Request\" title=\"Appointment Request\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1f/Book_Note_O_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Appointment_Request\" title=\"Appointment Request\">Appointment Request</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Invoice:_Flooding_Repairs\" title=\"Invoice: Flooding Repairs\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Book_Note_H_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_H_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Book_Note_H_Item_Icon.png/45px-B